  "notes": [
    "A row leaving the list on a filter change keeps its click handler while it animates out, so a click that lands right after the filter chip selects a row of the previous filter: measured on run3, the Running filter showed one working task and the detail opened the completed one. A 500 ms sleep after the chip lets the exit transition finish before the row is addressed.",
    "tasks-new opens the chat agent picker, which is where a task is assigned; the picker is closed with Escape and the page revisited. tasks-fab is the narrow-layout twin of that button (md:hidden) and never renders at 1280 px."
  ]
